  "description": "Partition string s such that every substring is a palindrome.",
  "target": "aab",
  "pseudocode": "1. dfs(start, currentPath)\n2. if start == s.length, add currentPath to results\n3. for end from start to s.length-1\n4.   if isPalindrome(s[start:end+1])\n5.     dfs(end+1, currentPath + [s[start:end+1]])",
